<title>USA: Western Resources seeks approval of deal.</title>
<headline>Western Resources seeks approval of deal.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources Inc sought approval from state regulators Friday for its proposed $2 billion acquisition of Kansas City Power and Light Co.</p>
<p>In a joint statement, the companies said they filed applications with the Kansas Corporation Commission and the Missouri Public Service Commission for clearance of the deal.</p>
<p>The companies said they also would seek approval from the U.S. Federal Energy Regulatory Commission and the Nuclear Regulatory Commission in the future, but they did not provide a specific date.</p>
<p>	     ((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
